/* ===== assets.js — heavy static data extracted verbatim from the
   original index.html monolith. Pure data, no logic: sticker/chibi
   images (base64), the KMath logo (base64 webp), two LaTeX document
   templates (MAIN_TEX / PHIEU_TNM), the bundled QR-code vendor library
   (TDK_QR), and the local voice-station installer bundle
   (KM_VOICE_FILES, incl. tdk_giong.py). MUST load before app.js: the
   remaining app code references these as bare top-level identifiers
   (classic <script> tags on one page share one global lexical scope,
   so this works exactly as it did when everything was one file).
   Exclude this file from Claude Project Context to save tokens — it
   is pure data and almost never needs to be read or edited. ===== */

